.TH OLLAMA\-MESH-KEY 1 "2026-08-17" "ollama-mesh dev" "ollama-mesh Manual"
.SH NAME
ollama\-mesh-key \- per\-API-key local/cloud routing overrides
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ollama\-mesh key
[action] [args] [\fIflags\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
per\-API-key local/cloud routing overrides
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B set\-local-only <name> <true|false>
block (or re\-allow) cloud fallback for one API key
.TP
.B set\-allow-local-degradation <name> <true|false>
let (or forbid) one API key receive a local alternate model
.SH FLAGS
.TP
.B \-\-server
Admin API base URL (default "http://localhost:8080", env MESH_SERVER)
.TP
.B \-\-json
output machine\-readable JSON instead of a human table
.TP
.B \-\-username
admin username, used to log in (env MESH_USERNAME)
.TP
.B \-\-password
admin password, used to log in (env MESH_PASSWORD)
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBollama\-mesh\fR(1)
